WEBVTT

00:00:00.825 --> 00:00:06.227
Calibrate the drawing against the 10 m dimension. Trace the four corners of panel P1 in order.

00:00:06.227 --> 00:00:11.139
Use the panel’s long side for a bonded strip. Enter the 200 mm depth from section A-A. The marked area is 15 square metres.

00:00:11.139 --> 00:00:15.226
The engineer adopts the effective span. At transfer, inspect top and bottom stresses at each bearing and at midspan. The centre line of each bar is zero stress.

00:00:15.226 --> 00:00:21.699
Switch to service. Compare signed top and bottom stresses with the external, prestress and combined section moments.

00:00:21.699 --> 00:00:27.308
Issue the calculation. Project Summary retains the original panel geometry, section reference and adopted span alongside the native calculation.
